WEBVTT

00:00:11.062 --> 00:00:12.981
GRAVES: To survive so long

00:00:14.357 --> 00:00:16.693
with this inside you, Credence,

00:00:18.027 --> 00:00:19.195
is a miracle.

00:00:19.737 --> 00:00:22.031
You are a miracle.

00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:24.701
Come with me.

00:00:25.493 --> 00:00:28.037
Think of what we could achieve together.

00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:30.081
(GROANS)

00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:37.005
(PANTING)

00:00:42.552 --> 00:00:43.553
TINA: Newt!

00:00:43.886 --> 00:00:45.638
It's the Second Salem boy.
He's the Obscurial.

00:00:46.097 --> 00:00:47.473
He's not a child.

00:00:48.099 --> 00:00:52.020
His power must be so strong
he's somehow managed to survive.

00:00:56.482 --> 00:00:57.734
TINA: Newt.

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:00.069
Save him.

00:01:05.575 --> 00:01:06.784
(ROARING)

00:01:07.577 --> 00:01:08.786
TINA: Mr. Graves.

00:01:21.758 --> 00:01:24.177
Tina, you're always turning up
where you're least wanted.

00:01:32.435 --> 00:01:34.103
(PANTING)

00:01:36.814 --> 00:01:38.316
SERAPHINA: Contain this.

00:01:38.858 --> 00:01:41.444
Or we are exposed, and it'll mean war.

00:01:52.288 --> 00:01:53.581
Credence.

00:01:53.998 --> 00:01:55.458
Credence, I can help.

00:02:20.233 --> 00:02:22.026
(ROARING)

00:02:24.862 --> 00:02:25.863
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:02:33.871 --> 00:02:35.623
(OFFICERS SCREAMING)

00:02:35.832 --> 00:02:36.874
(ROARS)

00:03:00.731 --> 00:03:07.071
CITY HALL

00:03:35.057 --> 00:03:36.225
-Bar the area.
-AUROR: Yes, sir.

00:03:36.392 --> 00:03:37.393
I don't want anyone else down there.

00:03:38.186 --> 00:03:39.270
(GASPS)

00:03:50.573 --> 00:03:51.741
NEWT: Credence...

00:03:54.744 --> 00:03:56.454
It is Credence, isn't it?

00:03:59.582 --> 00:04:01.918
I'm here to help you, Credence.

00:04:02.919 --> 00:04:05.129
I'm not here to hurt you.

00:04:07.965 --> 00:04:10.092
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

00:04:24.774 --> 00:04:27.443
I've met someone just like you, Credence.

00:04:30.738 --> 00:04:31.989
A girl.

00:04:33.491 --> 00:04:34.492
A young girl

00:04:34.951 --> 00:04:36.494
who'd been imprisoned.

00:04:38.204 --> 00:04:42.416
She had been locked away,
and she'd been punished for her magic.

00:05:00.559 --> 00:05:01.769
Credence.

00:05:05.106 --> 00:05:06.482
Can I come over to you?

00:05:10.152 --> 00:05:11.570
Can I come over?

00:05:16.867 --> 00:05:18.202
(GROANS)

